{
  "title": "Route Table · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "목적지 주소에 따라 트래픽을 보낼 경로를 정합니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Route Table</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/#guide-1\">경로를 읽는 방법</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/#guide-2\">여러 규칙이 일치할 때</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>네트워크</span><span>43 / 62</span></div><h1>Route Table</h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>라우팅 테이블은 <strong>네트워크 트래픽의 목적지를 보고 다음에 어디로 보낼지 정하는 규칙 모음</strong>입니다. 각 규칙에는 목적지 주소 범위와 트래픽을 넘겨줄 대상이 들어갑니다.</p><p>서브넷에 어떤 라우팅 테이블을 연결하느냐에 따라 인터넷, 다른 VPC, 사내망 등으로 통신할 수 있는 경로가 달라집니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"destination-and-target\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"local-route\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"longest-prefix-match\"></span><h2>경로를 읽는 방법</h2><p><strong>목적지와 대상:</strong> <code>0.0.0.0/0 → 인터넷 게이트웨이</code>는 더 구체적인 경로가 없는 IPv4 트래픽을 인터넷 게이트웨이로 보내라는 뜻입니다.</p><p>VPC 내부 주소로 향하는 기본적인 local 경로는 VPC 내부 통신에 사용합니다. 다른 VPC나 사내망으로 가는 경로는 피어링, Transit Gateway 등의 연결 대상으로 추가합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"main-route-table\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"route-propagation\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"blackhole-and-asymmetric-routing\"></span><h2>여러 규칙이 일치할 때</h2><p>라우팅은 목적지에 맞는 경로 중 <strong>주소 범위가 가장 구체적인 경로</strong>를 우선합니다. 이를 최장 접두사 일치<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup>라고 합니다. <code>/24</code>와 <code>/16</code>에 모두 포함되는 목적지는 일반적으로 <code>/24</code> 경로를 따릅니다.</p><p>경로가 존재해도 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">보안 그룹</a>이나 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/\">NACL</a>이 차단하면 통신할 수 없습니다. 요청이 가는 경로와 응답이 돌아오는 경로를 함께 확인합니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>트래픽의 경로 결정</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ol class=\"concept-flow\"><li><strong>목적지 확인</strong><span>패킷의 IP 주소</span></li><li><strong>일치 경로 비교</strong><span>가장 구체적인 범위</span></li><li><strong>대상으로 전달</strong><span>게이트웨이·연결 대상</span></li></ol><p class=\"diagram-note\">라우팅은 이동 경로를 정하며, 통신 허용 여부는 보안 규칙도 확인해야 합니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>일반 인터넷 요청은 NAT로 보내고 사내망 주소는 VPN으로 보내도록 구성합니다. 목적지 주소 범위가 달라 두 연결을 같은 서브넷에서 함께 사용할 수 있습니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>최장 접두사 일치</strong> — 목적지 IP와 일치하는 비트가 가장 많은 경로를 선택하는 원칙입니다. 동일한 목적지 범위의 경로가 여러 개일 때는 별도의 경로 우선순위가 적용됩니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/vpc/latest/userguide/VPC_Route_Tables.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Configure route tables ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q006/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q006\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q006\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q006</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q006/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which IP address falls within the 10.0.1.0/24 CIDR block?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q006\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">10.0.2.124</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q006\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">10.0.1.124</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q006\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">10.1.1.124</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q006\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">10.0.0.124</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · /24는 앞 24비트, 곧 이 예시의 10.0.1이 같아야 한다. AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> 예약 주소 여부도 별도로 확인한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">Subnet / CIDR</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q008\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q008\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q008</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q008/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A route table has 10.0.0.0/16 to a peering connection and 10.0.1.0/24 to a local target. Which principle determines the route for 10.0.1.25?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q008\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Shortest prefix match</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q008\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">The route created first</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q008\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Compare only the last octet</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q008\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Longest prefix match</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · 목적지 전체 IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span>와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">CIDR</a>을 비교해 더 구체적인 일치 경로를 우선한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">Subnet / CIDR</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/\">VPC Peering</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q009\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q009\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q009</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q009/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An EC2 instance in a public subnet must receive requests directly from internet clients. Which combination is required?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q009\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Only an S3 gateway endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q009\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a route to a NAT gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q009\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A route to an internet gateway, a public address, and permissive security rules</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q009\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a private IP address</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">IGW</a>로 향하는 경로와 외부에서 도달할 주소, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">SG</a>/<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/\">NACL</a> 허용이 함께 필요하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">Internet Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/\">Elastic IP</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q010\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q010\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q010</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q010/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An EC2 instance in a private subnet needs outbound IPv4 access to an internet package repository. What is a typical design?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q010\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A NAT gateway in a public subnet and a route from the private subnet to it</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q010\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Attach an internet gateway directly to the private subnet</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q010\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Deploy only CloudFront</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q010\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Use a Route 53 failover policy</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · 퍼블릭 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT</a>를 통해 외부 연결을 시작하고 응답받는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">Internet Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q011\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q011\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q011</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q011/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An application runs in two Availability Zones and uses zonal public NAT gateways. If one AZ fails, workloads in the surviving AZ must retain outbound internet access. Which NAT design should the architect use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q011\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Add only a network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q011\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Use a single NAT gateway in AZ A</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q011\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Deploy a NAT gateway in each AZ and route each subnet to its local NAT gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q011\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Attach one Elastic IP to both AZs simultaneously</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>별 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT</a>와 경로는 단일 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT</a> 의존을 제거하고 교차 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 트래픽도 줄인다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">이전 용어 <b>Route 53</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/\">다음 용어 <b>RPO / RTO</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
